@startuml activity_rekomendasi_saw
title Activity Diagram - Alur Rekomendasi SAW (UC-03)

|User|
start
:Klik tombol "Hitung SAW"\npada kluster (master+kendaraan+tier);

|Browser (AJAX)|
:POST /procurement/supplier-selection/hitung-saw\n(needlist_id, master_barang_id, variasi_ids);

|SupplierSelectionSawController\n::hitungSAW()|
:Validasi request\n(needlist_id, master_barang_id, variasi_ids);

:getInquiryDataByCluster(needlistId, variasiIds);
note right
  - Ambil SupplierInquiry status='responded'
  - Ambil item dgn id_variasi in variasiIds,
    harga_penawaran & estimasi_pengiriman terisi
  - 1 kombinasi (variasi, supplier) = 1 kandidat
  - Hitung C1 (harga) & C3 (lead time = selisih hari)
  - Dedup per kandidat (ambil C1 terendah)
end note

if (Jumlah kandidat >= 2?) then (tidak)
  :Response 422\n"Minimal 2 kombinasi variasi+supplier";
  stop
else (ya)
endif

:mergeWithHistoris(inquiryData);
note right
  Untuk setiap kandidat, ambil
  SawNilaiHistoris terbaru per supplier_id:
  - C2 = termin_pembayaran
  - C3 = lead_time historis (override jika > 0)
  - C4 = akurasi_kuantitas
  - C5 = tingkat_pemenuhan
  - C6 = komunikasi
  Jika tidak ada historis -> default 0
end note

:Hitung tierKey = md5(sort(variasiIds));
:Tentukan idVariasiForRecord\n(diisi jika hanya 1 variasi, else null);

|SawService::calculate()|
:Ambil kriteria aktif\n(SawKriteria::aktif());

if (Total bobot kriteria == 1.0?) then (tidak)
  :throw RuntimeException;
  |SupplierSelectionSawController|
  :Response 500 (error bobot kriteria);
  stop
else (ya)
endif

:buildMatrix()\n=> matriks Xij per kandidat x kriteria;
:normalize()\n=> Rij\n(BENEFIT: x/max, COST: min/x);
:weightedSum()\n=> Vi = Sigma(Wj x Rij);
:rank()\n=> urutkan desc berdasar Vi,\nset ranking & is_recommended;

:saveToDatabase() [DB Transaction];
note right
  - Upsert berdasar (needlist_id, id_barang, tier_key):
    hapus SawPerhitungan & detail lama jika ada
  - Create SawPerhitungan baru
    (snapshot bobot, status='draft', calculated_by)
  - Create SawPerhitunganDetail per kandidat
    (nilai_c1..c6, norm_c1..c6, weighted_c1..c6,
     nilai_vi, ranking, is_recommended, sumber_c1/c3)
end note

|SupplierSelectionSawController|
:Response JSON success\n(matrix, normalized, ranked, rekomendasi);

|View (Blade/JS)|
:Render panel hasil SAW\n(matriks keputusan, normalisasi,\nranking & rekomendasi terbaik);
stop
@enduml
